{"id":"98dcef147fbf32c9","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-measure6-nonatomic-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure6 Nonatomic Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure6-nonatomic-measure — ZFC Measure6 Nonatomic Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure6-nonatomic-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure6-nonatomic-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure6-nonatomic-measure — ZFC Measure6 Nonatomic Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure6-nonatomic-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure6-nonatomic-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure6-nonatomic-measure — ZFC Measure6 Nonatomic Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,A,B\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6NonatomicMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6NonatomicMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure6\\text{-}nonatomic\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6NonatomicMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A)&gt;0\\to\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(B\\subseteq A\\land\\mu(B)&gt;0\\land\\mu(A\\setminus B)&gt;0)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure6\\text{-}nonatomic\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6NonatomicMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A)&gt;0\\to\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(B\\subseteq A\\land\\mu(B)&gt;0\\land\\mu(A\\setminus B)&gt;0)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the no-atoms condition for arbitrary measures, including sets of infinite measure; the stricter inequality <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(B)&lt;\\mu(A)\">\\(\\mu(B)&lt;\\mu(A)\\)</span> is equivalent only under additional finiteness or semifiniteness assumptions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6NonatomicMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure6\\text{-}nonatomic\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6NonatomicMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A)>0\\to\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(B\\subseteq A\\land\\mu(B)>0\\land\\mu(A\\setminus B)>0)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu(B)<\\mu(A)","display":false}],"bytes":1156,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2620","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure6-nonatomic-measure.md|58-df-zfc-measure6-nonatomic-measure]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca832ed6bc22f728"]}